# === 敏感凭证（严禁提交，AGENTS.md 要求的红线）===
DEPLOY_CREDENTIALS.md
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
certs/
.env
.env.*
!/.env.example

# === Rust 构建产物 ===
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
